Package: omg
Type: Package
Title: Ortholog Marker Gene Cross-Species Cell Type Annotation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tran", "Chau", email = "chauducanh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Annotate cell types in plant single-cell/nucleus RNA-seq data by
    testing marker-gene ortholog overlap against a reference panel of plant
    species and tissues. Takes a Seurat FindAllMarkers() style CSV and returns
    cell-type predictions with confidence scores, the same outputs as the
    Omg_annotation.R command-line pipeline. Reference marker and orthogroup
    tables ship with the package and can be overridden with user-supplied files
    (e.g. an OrthoFinder run that adds a new species).
